WEBVTT

00:03.020 --> 00:04.190
Morning.

00:04.190 --> 00:05.900
You got new glasses?

00:08.570 --> 00:09.880
Morning.

00:09.880 --> 00:11.780
These are fashion glasses.

00:12.610 --> 00:14.410
The ones I bought because they were cute.

00:14.410 --> 00:16.660
I wore them here by accident.

00:18.580 --> 00:22.160
<i>I guess she's effectively forgotten 
her glasses today, then.</i>

00:22.160 --> 00:24.170
<b>Class 3-B</b>

00:28.630 --> 00:29.520
What? What what?

00:29.520 --> 00:30.970
Try them on.

00:30.970 --> 00:32.340
They aren't prescription anyway.

00:34.480 --> 00:36.340
Err, well...

00:36.710 --> 00:40.040
<i>Mie-san was wearing these glasses 
until just a moment again.</i>

00:40.040 --> 00:41.350
Err, well...

00:42.550 --> 00:44.010
They aren't dirty.

00:51.880 --> 00:53.470
I want to get a better look.

00:53.470 --> 00:54.730
Take a selfie and send it to me.

00:55.260 --> 00:56.320
<i>For real?!</i>

00:56.790 --> 00:58.540
M-Maybe not here.

00:58.540 --> 01:01.830
<i>Not that I've ever taken a 
selfie anywhere else, either.</i>

01:02.080 --> 01:03.740
You can take them home.

01:05.120 --> 01:07.830
Hang on, I have a case.

01:20.680 --> 01:22.170
Nope, don't take them off!

01:22.170 --> 01:23.490
But...

01:23.490 --> 01:25.180
You have to have them on for today.

01:34.740 --> 01:35.820
The Girl I Like 
her Glasses

01:35.820 --> 01:38.830
The Girl I Like 
Forgot her Glasses

02:58.030 --> 03:03.000
Episode 13

02:58.030 --> 03:03.000
The Girl I like and I Made a Promise

02:58.690 --> 03:01.460
This part's on a lot of entrance exams.

03:01.460 --> 03:03.650
Be sure you're ready to answer it.

03:03.650 --> 03:05.190
Especially this one.

03:05.190 --> 03:06.440
This one's tricky.

03:06.440 --> 03:08.150
Remember to check your work.

03:08.150 --> 03:09.140
Got it?

03:12.990 --> 03:14.880
<i>Her hair's so soft.</i>

03:15.520 --> 03:18.060
<i>Mie-san's hair is amazing.</i>

03:18.060 --> 03:20.950
<i>It even looks soft and shiny.</i>

03:20.950 --> 03:23.890
<i>And sometimes it smells </i>really<i> good.</i>

03:23.890 --> 03:26.780
<i>It must be the smell of her shampoo, right?</i>

03:29.120 --> 03:31.230
M-Mie-chan, do you have a moment?

03:31.850 --> 03:33.900
There's something I want to try.

03:33.900 --> 03:34.780
Sure.

03:35.860 --> 03:38.370
Okay, so, like this and like this.

03:38.370 --> 03:39.860
It's cute!

03:39.860 --> 03:42.400
You're so lucky you have such nice hair.

03:48.000 --> 03:49.090
<i>So cute!</i>

03:49.090 --> 03:50.000
<i>Wait...</i>

03:50.400 --> 03:51.750
<i>It's so cute!</i>

03:52.430 --> 03:54.260
<i>How does that even work?</i>

03:54.260 --> 03:56.230
<i>Tohyama-san's talented.</i>

03:55.380 --> 03:57.750
<b>Tohyama Maho-chan</b>

03:58.050 --> 03:59.510
<i>I was just staring at her.</i>

04:07.580 --> 04:09.300
<i>Stop staring! Stop staring!</i>

04:09.300 --> 04:13.110
<i>Mie-san would have caught me already, 
if she'd had her glasses on!</i>

04:20.110 --> 04:20.820
<i>I can't!</i>

04:20.820 --> 04:21.950
<i>I just keep staring!</i>

04:21.950 --> 04:25.230
<i>But it's strictly because 
of her cute hairstyle.</i>

04:25.230 --> 04:28.370
<i>It has nothing whatsoever to do 
with her being in a swimsuit.</i>

04:28.750 --> 04:31.540
<i>It doesn't have </i>nothing<i> to do 
with her being in a swimsuit.</i>

04:37.040 --> 04:39.520
<i>Does she not want to wear her swim cap?</i>

04:39.520 --> 04:41.550
<i>I guess her hair will come undone.</i>

04:44.450 --> 04:45.390
Komura?

04:46.060 --> 04:47.700
I w-wasn't looking!

04:47.700 --> 04:48.800
I wasn't looking!

04:49.250 --> 04:50.810
So anyway...

04:53.370 --> 04:55.840
<i>She has post-pool edition hair.</i>

04:57.380 --> 05:01.300
<i>It's a bit messy. Is she okay with that?</i>

05:01.300 --> 05:03.120
<i>Doesn't she want to undo her hair?</i>

05:03.120 --> 05:04.510
<i>Does she not notice?</i>

05:05.830 --> 05:07.490
Mie-san, your hair...

05:08.760 --> 05:10.460
You have a grain of rice stuck in it.

05:11.450 --> 05:13.220
Wh-Where?!

05:13.220 --> 05:13.910
Over here.

05:13.910 --> 05:15.170
<i>Oh, come on.</i>

05:15.170 --> 05:19.330
<i>I practically just admitted 
that I've been staring at her!</i>

05:19.330 --> 05:20.020
<i>I'm not looking!</i>

05:20.020 --> 05:20.920
<i>I'm not looking anymore!</i>

05:30.560 --> 05:31.940
<i>She undid it.</i>

05:32.330 --> 05:32.850
<i>Suddenly.</i>

05:34.500 --> 05:37.820
<i>Tohyama-san... Do it again, please?</i>

05:41.150 --> 05:44.290
The only forms of the verb 
"to be" are am, are, and is.

05:44.290 --> 05:47.520
In this situation, you'd use 
"is," as in, "What is this?"

05:47.520 --> 05:49.750
<i>Her hair's still a bit wet.</i>

05:50.170 --> 05:51.780
<i>Because it was bunched up, I guess?</i>

06:00.920 --> 06:03.170
<b>Moist...</b>

06:03.880 --> 06:05.210
What's wrong?

06:05.210 --> 06:07.520
Oh, err, well, I dunno...

06:07.520 --> 06:08.540
It's soggy.

06:11.730 --> 06:12.990
Sorry, I...

06:12.990 --> 06:15.330
No, it's totally fine.

06:15.330 --> 06:16.140
I can still read it.

06:16.140 --> 06:16.930
It's fine.

06:17.380 --> 06:21.190
Sorry. I guess I should tie up my hair.

06:21.490 --> 06:23.400
Y-Yeah?

06:24.190 --> 06:26.030
<i>Tohyama-san's going somewhere!</i>

06:26.650 --> 06:27.740
She's gone...

06:28.960 --> 06:30.880
Once Tohyama-san's back...

06:32.720 --> 06:33.820
<i>I made a mistake.</i>

06:39.450 --> 06:42.580
<i>I can totally feel the glare!</i>

06:45.160 --> 06:47.590
Maho-chan, can you do that thing again?

06:48.450 --> 06:49.800
<i>Yeah...</i>

06:49.800 --> 06:52.060
<i>You don't </i>see<i> someone glaring at you.</i>

06:53.000 --> 06:54.990
<i>You </i>feel<i> it.</i>

06:58.380 --> 07:00.600
<i>Maybe she knew all this time.</i>

07:04.170 --> 07:05.820
<i>The smell of chlorine...</i>

07:09.510 --> 07:12.570
What kind of fish do you like, Komura-kun?

07:12.570 --> 07:13.970
Salmon?

07:13.970 --> 07:15.090
Salmon, huh?

07:15.090 --> 07:16.480
That's classy.

07:16.480 --> 07:20.580
I'm interested in lumpfish these days.

07:17.750 --> 07:20.580
<b>Lumpfish</b>

07:21.050 --> 07:23.580
<i>I guess she wasn't asking about food?</i>

07:24.560 --> 07:27.750
But I still love flapjack octopuses the most.

07:27.750 --> 07:28.960
Yeah?

07:32.820 --> 07:34.580
I can tell flapjack octopuses.

07:36.630 --> 07:38.350
<i>We're walking home together again.</i>

07:38.870 --> 07:40.430
<i>Is she okay with this?</i>

07:41.100 --> 07:43.230
<i>Then again, Kawato-san and Tohyama-san</i>

07:43.230 --> 07:46.300
<i>usually can't walk home with 
her since they have club activities.</i>

07:43.230 --> 07:47.690
Kawato Asuka-chan

07:43.980 --> 07:47.690
Tohyama Maho-chan

07:48.270 --> 07:55.200
<i>Meanwhile, I'm her dad-like classmate 
who's sat next to her for a while now.</i>

07:55.640 --> 07:59.080
Okay, then, Komura-kun, what 
kind of clothes do you like?

08:00.610 --> 08:02.160
No, never mind.

08:02.160 --> 08:04.210
I'll figure it out myself.

08:04.760 --> 08:05.330
Okay.

08:06.480 --> 08:07.820
See you tomorrow.

08:11.170 --> 08:12.720
<i>It goes by so quick.</i>

08:12.720 --> 08:14.730
<i>She lives too close to school.</i>

08:17.480 --> 08:19.870
Mie, is that you? Long time no see.

08:21.120 --> 08:22.680
Don't you remember me?

08:23.960 --> 08:25.590
<i>Do they know each other?</i>

08:25.590 --> 08:26.520
<i>Hang on...</i>

08:26.520 --> 08:27.480
<i>Is he hitting on her?!</i>

08:27.950 --> 08:29.790
Sorry, my eyes...

08:29.790 --> 08:30.980
I can't see very well.

08:35.110 --> 08:37.500
May I get a look at your face?

08:39.920 --> 08:41.660
May I ask your name?

08:42.310 --> 08:43.180
It's Ise.

08:43.180 --> 08:45.010
From elementary school.

08:45.010 --> 08:46.860
Are you still forgetting your glasses?

08:49.290 --> 08:50.890
<i>They're acquaintances.</i>

08:50.890 --> 08:54.170
<i>I should get out of here, then.</i>

09:13.340 --> 09:14.230
Morning.

09:14.880 --> 09:16.070
Morning.

09:16.970 --> 09:19.110
<i>She forgot her glasses again.</i>

09:19.110 --> 09:20.580
<i>Two days in a row now.</i>

09:21.170 --> 09:24.150
I forgot where I left my glasses.

09:24.150 --> 09:26.480
<i>One of those cases where she 
doesn't know where it is.</i>

09:26.480 --> 09:30.240
I'm pretty sure I was wearing 
them when I left home yesterday.

09:30.240 --> 09:33.130
E-Either way, wanna share my textbook?

09:33.130 --> 09:33.840
Okay.

09:39.990 --> 09:43.480
Komura-kun, what does it say here?

09:43.480 --> 09:44.770
"To receive."

09:44.770 --> 09:46.850
Okay. Thanks.

09:56.980 --> 09:59.090
You still can't remember where your glasses are?

09:59.090 --> 10:01.680
Oh, I was thinking about something else.

10:01.680 --> 10:02.620
You were, huh?

10:03.380 --> 10:07.080
I ran into someone from my 
elementary school yesterday.

10:07.380 --> 10:10.130
I know his name now, since he told me,

10:10.720 --> 10:13.300
but I can't remember his face.

10:14.050 --> 10:17.630
Is it because I was already 
forgetting my glasses all the time?

10:21.880 --> 10:31.190
<i>The time I spent with Mie-san was mostly 
when she'd forgotten her glasses.</i>

10:32.880 --> 10:33.650
<i>Is she...</i>

10:34.330 --> 10:35.920
Good morning!

10:35.920 --> 10:36.900
<i>Going to...</i>

10:37.340 --> 10:38.610
Oh, hey, could you push me on the swing?

10:38.610 --> 10:40.970
<i>forget me someday?</i>

10:39.950 --> 10:40.970
You can have it.

10:45.040 --> 10:46.560
Hey, let's go tomorrow.

10:46.560 --> 10:47.170
Yeah!

10:47.700 --> 10:50.710
<b>Art Prep Room</b>

10:49.290 --> 10:50.710
Shall I carry those?

10:50.710 --> 10:52.700
That'd be great.

10:53.180 --> 10:54.720
I'll take one, too.

10:54.720 --> 10:55.880
Thanks!

10:59.380 --> 11:00.480
What's wrong?

11:00.480 --> 11:01.720
Nothing, just...

11:01.720 --> 11:04.100
It feels like my contacts aren't staying put.

11:04.830 --> 11:06.180
I need to use my eye drops.

11:06.690 --> 11:11.350
Do you ever forget your contacts?

11:12.320 --> 11:13.950
Are you talking about Mie-san?

11:15.790 --> 11:19.150
Maybe she doesn't need them as much.

11:19.690 --> 11:22.450
<i>It doesn't seem like she wouldn't.</i>

11:22.450 --> 11:23.930
Are you worried about Mie-san?

11:25.160 --> 11:28.910
You're kinda like her dad.

11:28.910 --> 11:34.420
I guess there could be a time when 
she suddenly stops forgetting.

11:35.180 --> 11:36.920
It's Bucchie!

11:38.460 --> 11:39.420
Komura?

11:40.130 --> 11:41.320
Why are you with Bucchie?

11:42.500 --> 11:44.430
We're carrying stuff.

11:46.830 --> 11:48.970
Tomorrow is the closing ceremony.

11:49.420 --> 11:52.730
It's summer break, but keep in mind 
you have entrance exams to study for.

11:53.260 --> 11:54.810
Let's walk home together.

11:55.770 --> 11:58.340
We're doing entrance exams now, huh?

11:58.340 --> 11:59.380
Yeah...

11:59.380 --> 12:01.400
We're going to have to study for the summer.

12:05.060 --> 12:07.330
Does that mean we can't hang out too much?

12:07.330 --> 12:08.910
Yeah, I guess so.

12:09.760 --> 12:12.290
I have plans to go on vacation 
with my family, though.

12:12.970 --> 12:14.850
We do have exams coming.

12:14.850 --> 12:17.130
<i>She's super depressed.</i>

12:17.130 --> 12:18.800
<i>I can't blame her. Entrance exams suck.</i>

12:19.340 --> 12:23.550
You gotta make sure you don't forget 
your glasses, right, Mie-san?

12:24.760 --> 12:26.560
I-I'll be fine!

12:26.560 --> 12:30.020
I bring a spare when I have tests!

12:30.020 --> 12:31.120
Yeah?

12:31.120 --> 12:32.210
You're right.

12:33.520 --> 12:37.980
<i>I wonder if Mie-san's ever going to 
 stop forgetting her glasses.</i>

12:39.030 --> 12:43.840
<i>If she does... will she still
remember me?</i>

12:47.070 --> 12:50.950
July 19
Closing Ceremony
9 AM: Gather at Gymnasium

12:49.010 --> 12:50.950
Hey, you found your glasses.

12:51.250 --> 12:52.070
Yeah.

12:52.070 --> 12:52.980
The day before yesterday.

12:52.980 --> 12:56.210
I went clothes shopping with 
Maho-chan and Asuka-chan.

12:56.750 --> 12:59.670
I'd forgotten them at 
the changing room there.

12:59.670 --> 13:02.780
So Tohyama-san and Kawato-san 
didn't notice, either?

13:03.630 --> 13:08.720
Oh, I recognized my classmate 
when I saw our grad album, too.

13:10.900 --> 13:11.930
Yeah?

13:12.660 --> 13:13.970
What was he like?

13:16.850 --> 13:18.240
Let's see...

13:18.240 --> 13:19.140
Just a second...

13:19.140 --> 13:19.900
I think...

13:20.320 --> 13:25.200
I think he used to tease me 
when I'd forgotten my glasses.

13:25.920 --> 13:29.220
He was the exact opposite of you.

13:31.220 --> 13:34.790
You always help me.

13:49.720 --> 13:56.010
<i>The day Mie-san stops forgetting her glasses 
might be the day Mie-san forgets me.</i>

14:00.250 --> 14:03.300
<i>How can I make sure she remembers me?</i>

14:10.400 --> 14:11.230
Mie-san.

14:19.710 --> 14:21.130
Let's go home together.

14:25.360 --> 14:27.400
We have a break for a while, huh?

14:27.980 --> 14:28.650
Yeah.

14:36.930 --> 14:37.780
Err...

14:39.750 --> 14:41.030
S-Sorry.

14:41.490 --> 14:42.940
Wh-What?

14:43.520 --> 14:46.590
W-Wanna stop by the park?

14:48.000 --> 14:51.580
I wonder if I can do back hip flips now.

14:57.350 --> 14:58.640
I'll pass.

15:00.770 --> 15:02.050
I wanna go on the swings!

15:02.050 --> 15:04.370
That's probably not a good idea either.

15:08.140 --> 15:09.720
The slide, then.

15:10.090 --> 15:12.320
I guess that's fine. I think.

15:13.020 --> 15:13.740
Yeah.

15:15.680 --> 15:17.050
You, too, Komura-kun.

15:18.490 --> 15:21.520
Is there enough space for 
two of us to go at once?

15:22.010 --> 15:23.110
Just come.

15:26.510 --> 15:28.230
Sit here.

15:30.590 --> 15:33.080
I'm pretty sure it's too small.

15:33.080 --> 15:34.360
It's fine.

15:34.360 --> 15:35.490
You'll just barely fit.

15:35.490 --> 15:38.450
<i>Isn't it a bad thing if 
I'm just barely fitting?</i>

15:42.190 --> 15:46.180
<i>Maybe my problem is that I'm 
always having skeevy thoughts.</i>

15:47.310 --> 15:50.970
<i>No, but this is definitely torture, right?</i>

15:51.430 --> 15:53.750
We shall now begin the viewing of your face.

15:54.160 --> 15:55.630
<i>Death sentence!</i>

15:56.360 --> 15:59.100
I've been holding back for a while.

15:59.100 --> 16:00.690
Y-Yeah.

16:00.690 --> 16:03.480
<i>I did notice she hadn't asked in a while.</i>

16:06.000 --> 16:08.980
And the break starts tomorrow.

16:17.110 --> 16:18.600
You, too, Komura-kun.

16:18.600 --> 16:19.490
Your hand.

16:30.050 --> 16:32.630
<i>I would have been content just being 
seen through those thick lenses.</i>

16:33.390 --> 16:37.010
<i>I would have been happy just being 
looked at by her beautiful eyes.</i>

16:38.620 --> 16:39.560
<i>Yet...</i>

16:42.620 --> 16:44.060
<i>Now I'm not...</i>

16:46.710 --> 16:48.080
<i>I'm not satisfied.</i>

16:51.510 --> 16:52.530
All done.

17:02.590 --> 17:03.960
Oh, I know.

17:04.900 --> 17:06.410
Get your phone.

17:07.830 --> 17:13.140
I was going to send it over LIME, but 
apparently the quality's better over AirDrop.

17:17.420 --> 17:19.480
It looks nice, right?

17:21.530 --> 17:23.410
I'm so sweaty.

17:24.070 --> 17:27.100
You're pretty sweaty, aren't you?

17:27.100 --> 17:29.940
<i>Crap, she knows I'm a creep!</i>

17:30.370 --> 17:33.260
Maybe it's because you're warm.

17:33.260 --> 17:34.480
Mie-san logic.

17:34.480 --> 17:36.110
You have warm hands.

17:36.110 --> 17:38.070
Maybe your whole body is warm.

17:40.550 --> 17:42.750
<i>It might be all right.</i>

17:44.310 --> 17:49.700
<i>As long as we have something to look 
back on, she might remember me.</i>

17:54.050 --> 17:59.260
Komura-kun, don't forget 
about me during the break.

18:11.110 --> 18:12.000
Bye.

18:18.640 --> 18:19.980
<i>I don't want to forget.</i>

18:20.910 --> 18:23.190
<i>I don't want Mie-san to be a mere memory.</i>

18:24.840 --> 18:28.930
<i>I want to keep looking at Mie-san.</i>

18:29.990 --> 18:32.410
<i>Even if she forgets her glasses.</i>

18:32.410 --> 18:34.340
<i>Even if she stops forgetting them.</i>

18:34.910 --> 18:37.920
<i>I have to try to make it 
so I can be by her side.</i>

18:38.620 --> 18:39.430
I...

18:40.560 --> 18:41.350
I...

18:42.710 --> 18:44.930
I want to see your face tomorrow, too!

18:48.220 --> 18:52.390
If not tomorrow, sometime 
during the summer break.

18:52.390 --> 18:54.020
I still want to see you.

19:07.710 --> 19:08.500
Yeah.

19:31.600 --> 19:32.970
U-Um...

19:35.260 --> 19:38.110
That ice cream is 130 yen.

19:38.650 --> 19:39.530
Huh?

19:39.530 --> 19:41.460
It's not 70 yen?

19:41.120 --> 19:44.120
Rich
Chocolate

19:41.910 --> 19:44.120
It's not a chocolate Gorigori-kun?

19:44.120 --> 19:47.620
Gorigori-kun       Apple Cigar

19:45.440 --> 19:47.200
Thank you.

19:47.970 --> 19:50.600
I have really bad eyesight.

19:50.600 --> 19:52.370
Don't you wear glasses?

19:52.900 --> 19:54.900
My glasses got stolen.

19:57.500 --> 20:00.060
I met Ise-kun from my class just now.

20:00.060 --> 20:02.880
He took my glasses and went away.

20:03.130 --> 20:05.680
Wh-Why would he do that?

20:05.680 --> 20:08.240
Bleah! It's mine now!

20:05.680 --> 20:11.430
<b>Bleah</b>

20:06.560 --> 20:11.430
I don't know, but he always 
does stuff like that.

20:11.920 --> 20:16.870
Dad says it's because he 
wants to be my husband.

20:18.040 --> 20:18.940
<i>I see.</i>

20:19.470 --> 20:24.690
<i>Kind of like how Kato-kun in my class 
is always picking on Sakai-san.</i>

20:25.520 --> 20:29.200
<i>But taking her glasses is too much.</i>

20:30.850 --> 20:32.510
Are you going to be okay on your own?

20:32.930 --> 20:34.080
Can you make it home alone?

20:35.880 --> 20:37.860
U-Um...

20:37.860 --> 20:39.290
You're nice.

20:41.130 --> 20:42.590
You're like Dad.

20:43.830 --> 20:46.340
I know where I live.

20:47.040 --> 20:50.700
I always forget my glasses, 
so I'm used to it.

20:50.700 --> 20:52.350
<i>You forget your glasses?</i>

20:52.960 --> 20:54.790
Although...

20:54.790 --> 20:56.350
I forget my glasses all the time,

20:57.150 --> 21:02.110
so maybe my husband should 
be a kind boy like you.

21:07.800 --> 21:08.740
Bye.

21:15.270 --> 21:16.200
Bye.
